<title>FINLAND: Kemira Jan-Aug profit up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Kemira Jan-Aug profit up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax 612 vs 524</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		3.6 vs 3.4</p>
<p> Net sales				    8,425 vs 8,419</p>
<p> Operating profit			     911 vs 971</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial items, before extraordinaries was 623 million markka (mean 621 million) in a 540 million to 702 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation				   653 vs 649</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 299 vs 447 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			 nil vs 196</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses		     nil vs 196</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			  612 vs 524</p>
<p> Minorities				charge 4 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    174 vs 108</p>
<p> Net profit				     434 vs 415</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	31.4 vs 30.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish chemicals group is Kemira Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0248</p>
</text>
